# Git 属性配置
# 参考：https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes
# 目的：统一换行符，避免 Windows 本地与 Linux CI 协作时出错

# 默认：所有文本文件使用 LF 换行符
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件，不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.bin binary
*.safetensors binary
